# Terminal emulator preference order for xdg-terminal-exec
# The first found and valid terminal will be used
#
# The first entry is a user copy of monstar's desktop entry whose id contains
# "ghostty" purely so the packaged omarchy-launch-screensaver accepts it as the
# default terminal and runs the real ghostty binary for the idle screensaver.
# Everything else still opens monstar. See the Comment in the desktop file.
dev.rockorager.monstar-ghostty.desktop
dev.rockorager.monstar.desktop
com.mitchellh.ghostty.desktop
